<title>UK: Peter Black full-year profit rises 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Peter Black full-year profit rises 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 1</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.77		  vs 15.65</p>
<p> Interim dividend	 4.13		   vs 3.79</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.50		   vs 5.05</p>
<p>Pretax before exceptional items</p>
<p>				7.6		    vs 9.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   122.2		  vs 125.0</p>
<p> Operating result	 13.8		   vs 12.5</p>
<p> Exceptional		5.98 loss	    vs 3.84 loss</p>
<p> Interest		   0.17 debit	   vs 0.02 debit</p>
<p>Tax			  2.87		   vs 3.15</p>
<p>Pay date		   Oct 28</p>
<p>Div registration date  Sept 24 Ex-div date		Sept 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Peter Black Holdings Plc makes and markets healthcare, beuaty and fashion products.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
